TranslationUnitDecl
|-ConceptDecl HasType
| |-TemplateTypeParmDecl class depth 0 index 0 T
| `-RequiresExpr 'bool'
|   `-TypeRequirement 'typename T::type' dependent
`-ConceptDecl HasMore
  |-TemplateTypeParmDecl class depth 0 index 0 T
  `-RequiresExpr 'bool'
    |-TypeRequirement 'typename T::value_type' dependent
    `-TypeRequirement 'typename T::template rebind<int>' dependent
